WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:18.893
of Nottingham still didn't realize that the rich butcher was Robin Hood.

2
00:00:18.913 --> 00:00:23.237
"How much money do you want for your horned animals?"

3
00:00:23.637 --> 00:00:24.398
asked the sheriff.

4
00:00:25.278 --> 00:00:27.881
His feast for the butchers was almost over.

5
00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:31.544
It was time to trick this foolish young man.

6
00:00:32.468 --> 00:00:36.291
"The animals are worth at least five hundred pounds," said Robin.

7
00:00:36.311 --> 00:00:42.156
"Well, I'd like to help you, but I don't have that much money," the sheriff replied.

8
00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:46.280
"How about three hundred pounds in silver and gold instead?"

9
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:51.744
"Hmm Robin pretended to consider the offer.

10
00:00:51.764 --> 00:00:55.147
"The animals are really worth more than that.

11
00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:57.809
But my family does need the money.

12
00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:01.192
All right, it's a deal."

13
00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:04.809
"Good! By the way, what's your name?"

14
00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:06.049
asked the sheriff.

15
00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.251
Robin tried hard not to smile.

16
00:01:09.271 --> 00:01:12.472
"My name is Robert of Locksley.

17
00:01:13.232 --> 00:01:15.333
You must come to inspect the animals."

18
00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:19.775
The two men shook hands and agreed to meet later that afternoon.

19
00:01:22.216 --> 00:01:24.517
Meanwhile Robin sold his cart and horse.

20
00:01:27.718 --> 00:01:31.300
Later that day Robin and the sheriff set off from Nottingham.

21
00:01:31.904 --> 00:01:35.026
The sheriff was on horseback while Robin ran beside him.

22
00:01:36.086 --> 00:01:38.908
The two men talked and laughed like old friends.

23
00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:44.411
But when they entered Sherwood Forest, the sheriff immediately stopped laughing.

24
00:01:44.431 --> 00:01:48.613
"May the heavens save us from that thief Robin Hood!"

25
00:01:48.954 --> 00:01:49.514
he cried.

26
00:01:54.397 --> 00:01:55.617
Robin laughed loudly.

27
00:01:55.637 --> 00:01:59.680
"You're in no more danger from Robin Hood than you are from me."

28
00:02:00.908 --> 00:02:03.249
"That makes me nervous," said the sheriff.

29
00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.391
Suddenly a herd of deer crossed their path.

30
00:02:07.091 --> 00:02:08.512
Robin's eyes twinkled.

31
00:02:08.532 --> 00:02:10.773
"Those are my horned animals!"

32
00:02:11.073 --> 00:02:11.513
he said.

33
00:02:11.533 --> 00:02:13.514
"What do you think of them, Sheriff?"

34
00:02:16.756 --> 00:02:18.296
The sheriff halted his horse.

35
00:02:19.537 --> 00:02:23.719
"These deer from the woods are your horned animals?"

36
00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:25.320
He scowled.

37
00:02:25.956 --> 00:02:27.157
"I'm going back to Nottingham.

38
00:02:27.257 --> 00:02:28.057
I don't trust you!"

39
00:02:28.478 --> 00:02:30.719
Robin caught hold of the sheriff's reins.

40
00:02:30.739 --> 00:02:32.840
"Why don't you stay awhile?"

41
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:33.901
said Robin.

42
00:02:33.921 --> 00:02:36.922
"I'm sure my brothers would like to meet you."

43
00:02:37.743 --> 00:02:40.244
He pulled out a horn and blew three times.

44
00:02:44.406 --> 00:02:47.868
Little John appeared, leading a large group of Robin's men.

45
00:02:47.888 --> 00:02:50.550
"Oh no."

46
00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:54.112
The sheriff gulped after he realized something.

47
00:02:54.892 --> 00:02:57.193
"This butcher is really Robin Hood!"

48
00:03:00.374 --> 00:03:02.034
"How can we help you, master?"

49
00:03:02.374 --> 00:03:04.055
Little John asked Robin Hood.

50
00:03:04.075 --> 00:03:08.196
"I've brought a guest to feast with us today," replied Robin Hood.

51
00:03:08.216 --> 00:03:12.917
"Let me introduce the Sheriff of Nottingham!"

52
00:03:13.657 --> 00:03:16.238
The men grumbled but removed their hoods.

53
00:03:17.058 --> 00:03:18.579
That was a sign of respect.

54
00:03:20.079 --> 00:03:23.140
Robin led the sheriff deeper and deeper into the forest.

55
00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:27.943
The sheriff said nothing, but his heart was sinking fast.

56
00:03:28.863 --> 00:03:33.347
It was well known that Robin always robbed the men he invited to his feasts.

57
00:03:34.267 --> 00:03:38.070
"Robin Hood is going to try to steal from me too," thought the sheriff.

58
00:03:38.891 --> 00:03:41.213
At last they came to a large oak tree.

59
00:03:42.033 --> 00:03:44.775
Robin sat down on a soft pile of moss.

60
00:03:44.795 --> 00:03:46.957
"Sit next to me, Sheriff."

61
00:03:47.357 --> 00:03:48.638
Robin patted the moss.

62
00:03:48.658 --> 00:03:50.940
"You'll enjoy this feast."

63
00:03:52.592 --> 00:03:57.536
Soon forest fires crackled, and the air was filled with the scent of meat cooking.

64
00:03:58.676 --> 00:04:02.339
While the food roasted, Robin's men entertained the sheriff.

65
00:04:03.319 --> 00:04:04.961
They put on an archery show.

66
00:04:08.723 --> 00:04:20.451
They played harps and sang They fought with staffs so skillfully, the sheriff started clapping along with the

67
00:04:20.491 --> 00:04:20.971
other men.

68
00:04:22.892 --> 00:04:25.813
He'd forgotten that he was with Robin Hood and his men!

69
00:04:27.153 --> 00:04:31.515
When the food was ready, everyone ate and drank until the moon rose.

70
00:04:31.535 --> 00:04:36.356
"Robin Hood still hasn't mentioned my money," the sheriff said to himself.

71
00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:39.437
"Maybe he has forgotten all about it."

72
00:04:40.958 --> 00:04:44.058
The sheriff stood up and addressed Robin and his men.

73
00:04:44.078 --> 00:04:48.800
"Thank you so much for this fine meal and wonderful entertainment.

74
00:04:49.952 --> 00:04:51.793
But I really must be going now.

75
00:04:52.053 --> 00:04:54.133
I don't want to get lost in the forest in the dark."

76
00:04:55.033 --> 00:04:56.934
Robin and his men stood up too.

77
00:04:56.954 --> 00:05:01.135
"I'm sorry to see you go," said Robin.

78
00:05:01.155 --> 00:05:03.856
"But you forgot one thing."

79
00:05:04.636 --> 00:05:06.457
The sheriff's heart sank again.

80
00:05:06.477 --> 00:05:11.398
"We don't give these feasts for free," went on Robin.

81
00:05:11.418 --> 00:05:15.619
"Our food and entertainment will cost you something."

82
00:05:16.499 --> 00:05:18.800
"Yes!" cried all his men.

83
00:05:19.532 --> 00:05:21.073
The sheriff forced a laugh.

84
00:05:21.093 --> 00:05:23.193
"Everything was so delightful.

85
00:05:23.453 --> 00:05:25.434
I was certainly planning to pay you something."

86
00:05:25.454 --> 00:05:29.975
"Three hundred pounds, please," said Robin.

87
00:05:29.995 --> 00:05:32.696
"What? Three hundred pounds!"

88
00:05:33.076 --> 00:05:34.016
sputtered the sheriff.

89
00:05:34.036 --> 00:05:38.477
"Actually, I wouldn't give you three pounds!"

90
00:05:38.497 --> 00:05:40.838
"Oh, that's too bad," Robin said.

91
00:05:40.858 --> 00:05:43.639
"Well, we'll just take what's in your pouch.

92
00:05:44.559 --> 00:05:47.240
Little John, would you empty it for the sheriff?"

93
00:05:49.228 --> 00:05:52.010
The sheriff's face turned pale, and he bit his lip.

94
00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:56.253
Little John took the sheriff's fat pouch and counted out the coins.

95
00:05:56.273 --> 00:06:02.077
"Three hundred pounds in silver and gold," said Little John.

96
00:06:02.097 --> 00:06:05.620
"Perfect." Robin beamed at the sheriff.

97
00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.102
"We enjoyed hosting you tonight, Sheriff.

98
00:06:09.822 --> 00:06:11.824
Be careful going home in the dark."
